++# -soc $(CURRENT_MACHINE_CONFIG_LC) and each component's conf/Makefile only pulls
++# MASTER.arm64.<machine> in when that file exists, so without it the build falls
++# back to Apple's stock arm64 master. That one expects the low-level symbols to
